      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3.21,
          "en": "(bright music)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.21,
          "end": 4.68,
          "en": "-: So basically, 'til this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.68,
          "end": 6.45,
          "en": "we were able to provide the security",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.45,
          "end": 8.25,
          "en": "with the help of Spring security.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "So whenever you try to access any resource which is secure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 14.67,
          "en": "basically we will get a login form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.67,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "and only when you're logged in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "you can access all the resources.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 19.47,
          "en": "And to achieve that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.47,
          "end": 21.78,
          "en": "we have used form based auto-authentication.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 21.78,
          "end": 26.19,
          "en": "I can simply use the code here and password is 1234.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 26.19,
          "end": 28.65,
          "en": "If I say enter, I'm logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.65,
          "end": 30.69,
          "en": "And then we have also seen that when you log in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.69,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "basically you, I mean, what we are doing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 35.82,
          "en": "is we are printing the text what we wanted to print.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.82,
          "end": 37.737,
          "en": "And also we are getting a session ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.737,
          "end": 41.49,
          "en": "That means in the browser, I do have this session ID here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 41.49,
          "end": 42.647,
          "en": "but there's one little problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 42.647,
          "end": 44.007,
          "en": "Okay, what's the problem now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.007,
          "end": 46.38,
          "en": "See the thing is when you're logged in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.38,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "of course in your cookies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 51.09,
          "en": "you'll be having this session ID, so that after some time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.09,
          "end": 52.354,
          "en": "also when you go to this website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 52.354,
          "end": 54.987,
          "en": "you don't have to log in once again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 54.987,
          "end": 58.47,
          "en": "Basically the moment you send request, it will check.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 58.47,
          "end": 59.64,
          "en": "We already have a session ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 59.64,
          "end": 62.28,
          "en": "It'll give me the login and no worries, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 62.28,
          "end": 63.78,
          "en": "And most of us do that, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 63.78,
          "end": 65.278,
          "en": "We try to save this session,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 65.278,
          "end": 67.95,
          "en": "or we say, okay, remember this session",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 67.95,
          "end": 71.03999999999999,
          "en": "because I don't want to log in every time I go there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 71.03999999999999,
          "end": 72.69,
          "en": "And I don't remember whenever the last time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 72.69,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "I logged into my Gmail account,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 76.71000000000001,
          "en": "Gmail account is already logged in in this machine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 76.71000000000001,
          "end": 77.82,
          "en": "And that's what we do, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 77.82,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "But there's one problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 81.57,
          "en": "The problem is what if I have a session right,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 81.57,
          "end": 83.107,
          "en": "now Gmail is already logged in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 83.107,
          "end": 87.84,
          "en": "and now I go to some other website which is malicious,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 87.84,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "and this website says it will search",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 92.03999999999999,
          "en": "for the cookie in my browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 92.03999999999999,
          "end": 95.25,
          "en": "It'll pick up the session ID for this particular site,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 95.25,
          "end": 96.446,
          "en": "which is my secure site.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 96.446,
          "end": 100.86,
          "en": "And then that particular malicious website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 100.86,
          "end": 103.68,
          "en": "is trying to access my secure website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 103.68,
          "end": 104.97,
          "en": "let's say a banking application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 107.43,
          "en": "and then provide the same session ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 107.43,
          "end": 109.47,
          "en": "the session ID which is taken from my browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 109.47,
          "end": 111.47999999999999,
          "en": "So this is called CSRF,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 111.47999999999999,
          "end": 114.06,
          "en": "which is cross site request forgery.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 114.06,
          "end": 115.439,
          "en": "So basically using the session ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 115.439,
          "end": 117.92099999999999,
          "en": "they can access the data or the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 117.92099999999999,
          "end": 119.91,
          "en": "Now that's tricky, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 119.91,
          "end": 121.38,
          "en": "So we want to secure that as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 124.2,
          "en": "So by default, Spring security will take care of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 124.2,
          "end": 126.375,
          "en": "So you don't have to manually configure it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 126.375,
          "end": 129.042,
          "en": "and to demonstrate that, we'll take an example, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 129.042,
          "end": 131.447,
          "en": "There are multiple ways of handling this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 131.447,
          "end": 135.147,
          "en": "One of the way is what if with every request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 135.147,
          "end": 137.999,
          "en": "what you get in return is a token, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 137.999,
          "end": 141.267,
          "en": "So that next time when you send the request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 141.267,
          "end": 144.087,
          "en": "you have to submit that token as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 144.087,
          "end": 145.59,
          "en": "Now when you talk about Http,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 145.59,
          "end": 147.03,
          "en": "we have different methods, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 147.03,
          "end": 148.95,
          "en": "Now out of all this methods like get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 148.95,
          "end": 151.02,
          "en": "post, create, put, delete, and many more,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 151.02,
          "end": 153.45,
          "en": "the get is the safest method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 153.45,
          "end": 156.57,
          "en": "because you don't change the data on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 156.57,
          "end": 158.216,
          "en": "But what about the post and delete?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 158.216,
          "end": 160.26,
          "en": "Now of course, every time you send this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 160.26,
          "end": 162.18,
          "en": "you are changing something from the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 162.18,
          "end": 166.35,
          "en": "So by default, Spring Security will implement the CSRF",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 166.35,
          "end": 170.55,
          "en": "for your put, delete and update and others,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 170.55,
          "end": 172.14,
          "en": "but not on get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 172.14,
          "end": 174.66,
          "en": "So what we'll do is let's create a controller",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 174.66,
          "end": 176.52,
          "en": "for maybe, let's say for a student.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 176.52,
          "end": 179.403,
          "en": "And let's try to see how this CSRF works there.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
